might decide that you're going to be better off in a society
where people's talents aren't as wasted as they are in a statist
one--they're sell you things that you wouldn't be imaginiative
enough to think of ordering them to do. Or you might decide
that you're better at trading than ordering and manipulating
so that, even if some people would gain in a statist society,
you wouldn't.

